    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "52d1cbc9e98a730cd29a": "Elder Dreamseer resides in Gadgetzan in Tanaris Desert.",
        "5801d16d81c6179e203a": "If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing.",
        "84ae5d33dd2bedcfc8ed": "Elder Ragetotem spends her days at the Valley of the Watchers in Tanaris Desert.",
        "a2ca7e25ed7350a7e348": "Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus.",
        "ba48187cfb36975a04a9": "Zul'Farrak in Tanaris Desert is Elder Wildmane's home.",
        "e5aa0c11c59591c1bbed": "In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?"
      },
      "name": "Elder Thunderhorn",
